# Raw BitAgent evaluation admission identities are local-only. Evaluation
# docs require all source/review/result artifacts to live outside this repo;
# this extra pattern prevents the most sensitive sidecar from being staged by
# accident when an operator uses the recommended suffix.
*privacy-sidecar*.json

